title A child reports back

parent "Parent agent" state running
tool   "subagent tool"
child  "agent-1" state idle
inbox  "Parent inbox" queue
steps  "Child steps" counter 0

task at parent

# A parent hands a search to a child so its own history stays short.
pause "The parent asks for a search it does not want in its own history."

# The tool starts the child and returns at once.
task -> tool
task -> child : running "The tool result is only: started subagent agent-1."
child : running

# The parent has nothing else to do, so its turn ends.
parent : idle "Its step ended while the child still works."

# The child works alone; its tool results stay in its own record.
steps +1
steps +1
steps +1 "Three steps, none of them in the parent's history."

# Settlement: the child's closing reply becomes one message.
child : done
remove task
new notice at child
notice -> inbox "The parent is idle, so the notice goes in as a followup."

# The notice wakes the parent and opens its next turn.
notice -> parent
parent : running "Turn 2 starts with the child's closing message."
remove notice
